Z||000003||mshill||11-26-2000||05:10 PM||||Old Lar is right about the 3.4L being the best bang for the buck, but even at my pick-n-pull you cannot get it for $50 (if you could find one).<P>I paid $900 delivered for a long block with 50K on it.  Maybe a little much, but better than the $1800 plus core charge for a crate from GM.||||reg||1
